    {
      "id": "emfo",
      "code_hash": "a91df49b4337aee8cef15bbf2dfc059a",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">All nine cases agree, so the merged filter keeps exactly the rows the two\nseparate filters keep. Lean checks the same nine cases, and then lifts the\nresult to <em>every</em> table by reasoning about lists in general.</span>\n<h2 id=\"why-null-breaks-obvious-rewrites\">Why NULL breaks \"obvious\" rewrites</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Here's a rewrite that looks harmless:</span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>WHERE a = a</code> \u27f6 <code>WHERE true</code>  <em>(every value equals itself, right?)</em></span>\n</blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">It's <strong>wrong</strong>: <code>NULL = NULL</code> is NULL, not true, so the original query\ndrops rows where <code>a</code> is NULL and the rewritten one keeps them.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Testing finds this bug only if your test data happens to contain NULLs.\nTry it: generate random test tables and see how often the bug is caught.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Hstk",
      "code_hash": "d77615a10af2d6e5049f52c563af017f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='Hstk-0' random-id='f1d20d3a-5712-00e8-7ee2-915c64061eb5'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='0.0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003echance a value is NULL&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='0' data-stop='0.5' data-step='0.01' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='true' data-include-input='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='Hstk-1' random-id='4a3d58a4-b4a1-e7e7-07c5-7b2ef33184c7'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='20' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003enumber of random test tables&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='1' data-stop='200' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='true' data-include-input='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element></div>"
