          "data": {
            "text/html": "<marimo-accordion data-labels='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eTry it in Lean&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-multiple='false' data-expanded='[]'><div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">In <code>SubstraitLean/Rewrites.lean</code>, try to prove <code>filter_project_pushdown</code>\n<strong>without</strong> the hypothesis <code>hp</code>. Lean gets stuck exactly where a filter\nreads a column that only exists after the projection. <code>lake build</code> from\nthe project root re-checks every proof in a few seconds.</span></span></div></marimo-accordion>"
